TITLE:: PV_HPfiltre
summary:: Selects a range of spectral bins
categories:: UGens>FFT
related:: Classes/FFT, Classes/IFFT, Classes/PV_ChainUGen

DESCRIPTION::
Keeps or processes a range of spectral bins defined by a starting index and a size. This UGen must be placed between FFT and IFFT.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new

ARGUMENT:: chain
A PV chain produced by FFT or another PV UGen.

ARGUMENT:: index
The starting index of the spectral range.

ARGUMENT:: size
The number of bins in the spectral range.

RETURNS::
A PV chain.

EXAMPLES::

code::
(
{
    var source = WhiteNoise.ar(0.05);
    var chain = FFT(LocalBuf(2048), source);
    chain = PV_HPfiltre(chain, 10, 100);
    IFFT(chain) ! 2
}.play;
)
::
